missed
    (未|漏|没{有})接{的}
    没接{到|着|成}{的}
    (漏掉|错过)

new
    (新{的}|un{-}read|未(听|看|读){的}) [exists;node="phoneCallNoun,voiceMailNoun";constraint=after]
    {还}没(听|看|读){过}{的}[exists;node="phoneCallNoun,voiceMailNoun";constraint=after]

recent
    最(近|后|新){的}

last
    上{一}(次|个)
    刚(刚|才){的} [conf=high]
    了 ; English uses simple past tense "called me" to infer this category. Chinese needs to catch the present perfect tense or otherwise the behavior can't be consistent.

received
    (收|接)到{的}
    呼入{的}
    给我 [exists;node=phoneCallVerb;category=find][exists;node=phoneCallNoun;category=call]

outgoing
    {最近}(拨出|呼出|打出){过|去}{的}
    {最近}拨{过}的
